#: docs/index.md:block 4 (paragraph)
msgid ""
"The Klipper firmware controls 3d-Printers. It combines the power of a general "
"purpose computer with one or more micro-controllers. See the [features "
"document](https://www.klipper3d.org/Features.html) for more information on why"
" you should use the Klipper software."
msgstr ""

#: docs/index.md:block 5 (paragraph)
msgid ""
"Start by [installing Klipper "
"software](https://www.klipper3d.org/Installation.html)."
msgstr ""

#: docs/index.md:block 6 (paragraph)
msgid ""
"Klipper software is Free Software. Read the "
"[documentation](https://www.klipper3d.org/Overview.html), see the "
"[license](COPYING), or [download](https://github.com/Klipper3d/Klipper) the "
"software. We depend on the generous support from our "
"[sponsors](https://www.klipper3d.org/Sponsors.html)."
msgstr ""

